WEBVTT

00:10:10.543 --> 00:10:12.910
<i>Drew: like when you put
on "a little" eye shadow.</i>

00:10:17.346 --> 00:10:19.378
<i>And, you know, all this stuff,</i>

00:10:19.413 --> 00:10:21.378
<i>It's just very unprofessional.</i>

00:10:21.413 --> 00:10:23.978
<i>Don't touch the troll!</i>

00:10:24.011 --> 00:10:26.445
<i>Is that what your mom
used to say to your dates?</i>

00:10:32.346 --> 00:10:33.879
<i>Put the trolls down,</i>

00:10:33.913 --> 00:10:36.011
<i>Or i'll put a staple
right between your eyes.</i>

00:10:37.045 --> 00:10:38.745
<i>Now, i know it's hard.</i>

00:10:38.779 --> 00:10:41.545
<i>It's hard to look up when you're down.</i>

00:10:41.579 --> 00:10:44.378
<i>It's hard to look up and see the light.</i>

00:10:44.413 --> 00:10:47.645
<i>But i'm here to tell you folks...</i>

00:10:47.679 --> 00:10:49.312
<i>The lord is with you.</i>

00:11:00.645 --> 00:11:03.212
<i>You don't have to suffer.</i>

00:11:03.245 --> 00:11:05.212
<i>You don't have to be lost.</i>

00:11:05.245 --> 00:11:07.378
<i>The lord is talking to you right now.</i>

00:11:07.413 --> 00:11:10.579
<i>He's saying, "you are my
child, and you have a purpose."</i>

00:11:11.879 --> 00:11:14.679
<i>You think god forgot
about you? I tell you, no!</i>

00:11:14.712 --> 00:11:16.278
<i>All you got to do is listen.</i>

00:11:16.312 --> 00:11:18.846
<i>Can't you just hear
those angels singing?</i>

00:11:18.879 --> 00:11:20.413
<i>Isn't it beautiful?</i>

00:11:22.812 --> 00:11:24.645
<i>It's time.</i>

00:11:24.679 --> 00:11:27.545
<i>It's time to receive
the message he's sending.</i>

00:11:27.579 --> 00:11:31.178
<i>It's time to listen to the word of god!</i>

00:11:31.212 --> 00:11:33.947
<i>Can you hear the glory?</i>

00:11:33.978 --> 00:11:35.913
<i>I said, can't you just hear it?</i>

00:11:35.947 --> 00:11:38.645
<i>I say, can't you just hear the lord?</i>

00:12:15.295 --> 00:12:17.828
Good morning. You're not the usual guy.

00:12:19.496 --> 00:12:22.928
No, uh... just filling in.

00:12:22.962 --> 00:12:25.329
So, how you feeling today, gloria?

00:12:25.362 --> 00:12:27.928
I've never felt better.

00:12:27.962 --> 00:12:31.396
So, no disturbances lately?

00:12:31.429 --> 00:12:34.129
You mean, am i stark-Raving
cuckoo for cocoa puffs?

00:12:34.163 --> 00:12:36.728
I didn't say that.

00:12:36.762 --> 00:12:38.962
It's all right. I know
what people must think.

00:12:38.995 --> 00:12:41.362
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:12:41.396 --> 00:12:43.862
I think what i saw was real.

00:12:56.862 --> 00:12:59.728
I'd like to know what you saw.

00:13:03.029 --> 00:13:05.195
It was all over the news.

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:06.995
I stabbed a man in the heart.

00:13:07.029 --> 00:13:08.828
Why would you do that?

00:13:08.862 --> 00:13:10.628
Because it was god's will.

00:13:12.195 --> 00:13:13.995
Did god talk to you?

00:13:14.029 --> 00:13:17.728
I get the sense god's a
little busy for house calls.

00:13:17.762 --> 00:13:20.995
No, he -- He
sent someone.

00:13:21.029 --> 00:13:22.396
Someone?

00:13:22.429 --> 00:13:24.429
An angel.

00:13:26.329 --> 00:13:30.695
It came to me in this
beautiful white light.

00:13:30.728 --> 00:13:35.828
And it filled me with this...feeling.

00:13:35.862 --> 00:13:38.695
It's -- It's
hard to describe.

00:13:38.728 --> 00:13:40.329
And this angel...

00:13:40.362 --> 00:13:42.195
Spoke god's word.

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:46.029
And the word was to kill someone?

00:13:46.062 --> 00:13:49.462
I know it sounds strange.

00:13:49.496 --> 00:13:51.695
But what i did was very important.

00:13:51.728 --> 00:13:54.029
I helped him smite an evil man.

00:13:54.062 --> 00:13:56.962
I was chosen...

00:13:56.995 --> 00:13:59.496
For redemption.

00:13:59.528 --> 00:14:02.462
This man you stabbed -- Did
the angel give you his name?

00:14:02.496 --> 00:14:03.795
No.

00:14:03.828 --> 00:14:06.561
He just told me to wait for the sign,

00:14:06.596 --> 00:14:08.329
And the very next day,

00:14:08.362 --> 00:14:10.596
I saw it right beside the man's doorway,

00:14:10.628 --> 00:14:11.795
And i knew.

00:14:11.828 --> 00:14:12.895
Why him?

00:14:12.928 --> 00:14:15.462
I just know what
the angel told me --

00:14:15.496 --> 00:14:19.195
That this man was guilty
to his deepest foundations.

00:14:21.195 --> 00:14:23.129
And that was good enough for me.

00:14:43.195 --> 00:14:45.329
Hey.

00:14:52.429 --> 00:14:53.795
Sam: hey!

00:14:55.129 --> 00:14:57.528
Hey, man, you got to try this.

00:14:57.561 --> 00:14:59.862
I mean, there really is
magic in the magic fingers.

00:14:59.895 --> 00:15:02.729
Dean, you're enjoying that way too much.

00:15:02.762 --> 00:15:04.895
It's kind of making me uncomfortable.

00:15:04.928 --> 00:15:07.561
You got me on lockdown here.
I'm bored out of my skull.

00:15:07.596 --> 00:15:11.962
Hey, you were the bank robber
on the 11:00 news, not me.

00:15:11.995 --> 00:15:14.561
We can't risk you just walking
into a government facility.

00:15:14.596 --> 00:15:15.596
Mmm.

00:15:21.362 --> 00:15:23.362
Aw, damn it.

00:15:23.396 --> 00:15:25.230
That was my last quarter.

00:15:25.262 --> 00:15:26.895
Hey!

00:15:26.928 --> 00:15:28.795
You got any quarters?

00:15:28.828 --> 00:15:30.096
No.

00:15:32.129 --> 00:15:34.096
So, did you get in to
see that crazy hooker?

00:15:34.129 --> 00:15:36.029
Yeah. Gloria sitnik.

00:15:36.062 --> 00:15:37.862
And i'm not so sure she's crazy.

00:15:37.895 --> 00:15:39.596
But she seriously believes

00:15:39.628 --> 00:15:41.429
That she was... touched by an angel?

00:15:41.462 --> 00:15:43.062
Yeah.

00:15:43.096 --> 00:15:45.596
Blinding light, feelings of
spiritual ecstasy, the works.

00:15:45.628 --> 00:15:48.362
I mean, she's living in a locked ward,

00:15:48.396 --> 00:15:50.396
And she's totally at peace.

00:15:50.429 --> 00:15:52.462
Oh, yeah, you're right
-- Sounds completely sane.

00:15:52.496 --> 00:15:54.295
What about the dude she stabbed?

00:15:54.329 --> 00:15:55.795
Uh, carl gulley.

00:15:55.828 --> 00:15:57.596
Said she killed him 'cause he was evil.

00:15:57.628 --> 00:15:59.062
Was he? I don't know.

00:15:59.096 --> 00:16:01.096
I couldn't find any dirt on him.

00:16:01.129 --> 00:16:02.729
He didn't have a criminal record,

00:16:02.762 --> 00:16:05.129
He worked at the campus
library, had lots of friends,

00:16:05.163 --> 00:16:06.828
Was a churchgoer.

00:16:06.862 --> 00:16:09.962
Hmm. So gloria's just
your standard-Issue wacko?

00:16:09.995 --> 00:16:13.528
I mean, she wouldn't be
the first nutjob in history

00:16:13.561 --> 00:16:16.262
To kill in the name of
religion, know what i mean?

00:16:16.295 --> 00:16:18.029
No, but she's the second in town

00:16:18.062 --> 00:16:20.163
To murder because an angel told them to.

00:16:20.195 --> 00:16:21.695
Little bit odd, don't you think?

00:16:21.729 --> 00:16:23.462
Odd -- Yeah.
Supernatural -- Maybe.

00:16:23.496 --> 00:16:25.195
But angels -- I
don't think so.

00:16:25.230 --> 00:16:26.695
Why not?

00:16:26.729 --> 00:16:29.596
'Cause there's no such thing, sam.

00:16:29.628 --> 00:16:33.029
Dean, there's 10 times
as much lore about angels

00:16:33.062 --> 00:16:35.496
As there is about anything
else we've ever hunted.

00:16:35.528 --> 00:16:37.396
There's a ton of lore on unicorns, too.

00:16:37.429 --> 00:16:40.096
I hear that they ride
on silver moonbeams

00:16:40.129 --> 00:16:42.329
And they shoot rainbows
out of their ass.

00:16:42.362 --> 00:16:44.329
Wait, there's no such thing as unicorns?

00:16:44.362 --> 00:16:46.262
That's cute.

00:16:46.295 --> 00:16:48.828
I'm just saying, man,
there's some legends

00:16:48.862 --> 00:16:52.062
That you just file under "bull crap."

00:16:52.096 --> 00:16:54.795
And you got angels on
the "bull crap" list?

00:16:54.828 --> 00:16:55.862
Yep.

00:16:55.895 --> 00:16:56.962
Why?

00:16:56.995 --> 00:16:59.462
Because i've never seen one.

00:16:59.496 --> 00:17:00.729
So what?

00:17:00.762 --> 00:17:03.230
So i believe in what i can see.

00:17:03.262 --> 00:17:05.096
Dean, you and i have seen things

00:17:05.129 --> 00:17:07.063
Most people couldn't even dream about.

00:17:07.096 --> 00:17:08.662
Exactly.

00:17:08.695 --> 00:17:11.063
With our own eyes --
That's hard proof, okay?

00:17:11.096 --> 00:17:12.528
But in all this time,

00:17:12.561 --> 00:17:14.996
I have never seen anything
that looks like an angel.

00:17:15.029 --> 00:17:17.962
Don't you think we would
have crossed paths with them

00:17:17.996 --> 00:17:20.262
Or at least know someone
that crossed paths with them?

00:17:20.295 --> 00:17:23.029
No. This is a demon or a spirit.

00:17:23.063 --> 00:17:25.496
They find people a few
fries short of a happy meal,

00:17:25.528 --> 00:17:27.429
And they trick them into
killing these randoms.

00:17:27.462 --> 00:17:29.362
Maybe.

00:17:31.996 --> 00:17:34.396
Can we just -- I'm
going stir-Crazy, man.

00:17:34.429 --> 00:17:37.230
Let's go by gloria's apartment, huh?

00:17:37.262 --> 00:17:39.628
I was just there. Nothing.

00:17:39.662 --> 00:17:41.362
No sulfur, no e.M.F.

00:17:41.396 --> 00:17:44.496
You didn't see any fluffy,
white wing feathers?

00:17:45.895 --> 00:17:48.362
But gloria did say the
angel gave her a sign

00:17:48.396 --> 00:17:50.695
Right beside carl gulley's doorway.

00:17:50.729 --> 00:17:53.795
Could be something at his
house. It's worth checking out.

00:18:19.762 --> 00:18:22.295
Hey, sam.

00:18:22.329 --> 00:18:24.828
Think i found it.

00:18:27.445 --> 00:18:30.413
It's a sign from up above.

00:18:36.512 --> 00:18:39.478
I think i learned a valuable lesson.

00:18:39.512 --> 00:18:41.913
Always take down your
christmas decorations

00:18:41.945 --> 00:18:43.246
After new year's,

00:18:43.278 --> 00:18:46.211
Or you might get filleted
by a hooker from god.

00:18:46.246 --> 00:18:50.545
I'm laughing on the inside.

00:19:12.679 --> 00:19:14.211
You know, gloria said

00:19:14.246 --> 00:19:16.545
The guy was guilty to
his deepest foundations.

00:19:16.578 --> 00:19:20.146
You think she literally
meant the foundation?

00:19:39.679 --> 00:19:41.779
Hmm.

00:20:03.746 --> 00:20:07.146
You got something?

00:20:09.246 --> 00:20:10.913
What is it?

00:20:15.079 --> 00:20:17.146
It's a fingernail.

00:20:38.079 --> 00:20:41.846
So much for the innocent
churchgoing librarian.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:43.779
Whatever spoke to gloria about this

00:20:43.813 --> 00:20:46.512
Knew what it was talking
about -- I'll give you that.

00:22:35.545 --> 00:22:36.612
Yes?

00:22:36.645 --> 00:22:39.478
Hi. My name is zach.

00:22:39.512 --> 00:22:41.012
Can i help you?

00:22:42.311 --> 00:22:44.278
Ugh!

00:23:11.815 --> 00:23:13.815
Did you bring quarters?

00:23:17.699 --> 00:23:21.320
Dude, i'm not enabling your sick habit.

00:23:21.398 --> 00:23:23.782
You're like one of those lab rats

00:23:23.795 --> 00:23:25.815
That pushes the pleasure button
instead of the food button

00:23:25.828 --> 00:23:26.628
Until it dies.

00:23:27.112 --> 00:23:29.045
What are you talking about?
I eat. And i got news.

00:23:29.078 --> 00:23:31.078
Me too. All right, you go first.

00:23:31.112 --> 00:23:33.279
Three students have disappeared
off the campus this year.

00:23:33.313 --> 00:23:34.945
All of them were last
seen at the library.

00:23:34.978 --> 00:23:38.413
Where carl gulley worked. Sick bastard.

00:23:38.445 --> 00:23:40.045
So gloria's
angel -- Angel?

00:23:40.078 --> 00:23:42.045
Okay, whatever this thing is.

00:23:42.078 --> 00:23:44.878
Whatever it is, it struck again. What?

00:23:44.913 --> 00:23:46.746
I was listening to the police radio.

00:23:46.778 --> 00:23:48.945
There was this guy, zach
smith, some local drunk.

00:23:48.978 --> 00:23:51.078
He went up to a stranger's
front door last night,

00:23:51.112 --> 00:23:52.646
Stabbed him in the heart.

00:23:52.679 --> 00:23:55.078
I'm guessing he went to
the police and confessed?

00:23:55.112 --> 00:23:57.212
Yep. Roma downey made him do it.

00:23:57.246 --> 00:23:59.313
Now, i, uh...

00:23:59.346 --> 00:24:02.878
Got the victim's address.

00:24:36.762 --> 00:24:38.295
Find anything?

00:24:38.328 --> 00:24:40.496
Frank liked his catalog shopping.

00:24:40.529 --> 00:24:42.429
That's about all i got. You?

00:24:42.462 --> 00:24:44.295
Not much here.

00:24:44.328 --> 00:24:47.262
Except he's got this one locked
file on his computer that...

00:24:47.295 --> 00:24:48.795
Hold on.

00:24:56.462 --> 00:24:59.128
Not anymore.

00:25:00.862 --> 00:25:03.328
God. What?

00:25:03.362 --> 00:25:05.128
He's got all these e-Mails,

00:25:05.161 --> 00:25:08.262
Dozens, to this lady named jennifer.

00:25:12.328 --> 00:25:15.462
This lady who's 13 years old.

00:25:15.496 --> 00:25:17.395
Oh, i don't want to hear this.

00:25:17.429 --> 00:25:19.829
Looks like they met in a chat room.

00:25:19.862 --> 00:25:24.096
These e-Mails are
pretty personal, dean.

00:25:24.128 --> 00:25:25.563
Look at that.

00:25:25.596 --> 00:25:28.328
Setting up a time and
place to meet. Great.

00:25:28.362 --> 00:25:32.028
They were supposed to meet today.

00:25:33.496 --> 00:25:34.596
Huh.

00:25:34.630 --> 00:25:37.195
Well, i guess if you're
gonna stab someone,

00:25:37.228 --> 00:25:39.195
Good timing.

00:25:39.228 --> 00:25:41.663
I don't know, man. This is weird.

00:25:41.695 --> 00:25:44.896
I mean, sure, some spirits
are out for vengeance,

00:25:44.929 --> 00:25:47.462
But this one's almost
like a do-Gooder, like a --

00:25:47.496 --> 00:25:49.295
Avenging angel?

00:25:49.328 --> 00:25:52.395
Well, how else do you explain it, dean?

00:25:52.429 --> 00:25:54.395
Three guys not connected to each other

00:25:54.429 --> 00:25:56.061
All stabbed through the heart?

00:25:56.096 --> 00:25:58.630
At least two were world-Class pervs,

00:25:58.663 --> 00:26:00.896
And i bet if you dug deep
enough on the other guy --

00:26:00.929 --> 00:26:02.328
Hey. What?

00:26:02.362 --> 00:26:04.228
You said carl gulley
was a churchgoer, right?

00:26:04.262 --> 00:26:05.328
Yeah.

00:26:05.362 --> 00:26:07.695
What was the name of his church?

00:26:07.730 --> 00:26:11.829
Uh... our lady of the angels?

00:26:11.862 --> 00:26:13.929
Of course that would be the name.

00:26:13.962 --> 00:26:16.061
Looks like frank went
to the same church.

00:26:26.096 --> 00:26:28.262
Man: so, you're interested
in joining the parish?

00:26:28.295 --> 00:26:31.096
We just don't feel right unless
we hit church every sunday.

00:26:31.128 --> 00:26:32.663
Where'd you say you lived before?

00:26:32.695 --> 00:26:33.996
Premont, texas.

00:26:34.028 --> 00:26:37.328
Really? At's a nice
town. St. Teresa's parish.

00:26:37.362 --> 00:26:38.896
You must know the priest there.

00:26:38.929 --> 00:26:42.061
Sure, yeah. No, it's fr. O'malley.

00:26:42.096 --> 00:26:44.529
I know a fr. Shaughnessy.

00:26:44.563 --> 00:26:46.529
Shaughnessy, exactly. What did i say?

00:26:46.563 --> 00:26:48.663
You know, we're just happy
to be here now, father.

00:26:48.695 --> 00:26:49.929
And we're happy to have you.

00:26:49.962 --> 00:26:52.829
We could use some
young blood around here.

00:26:52.862 --> 00:26:55.228
I got to ask -- No offense,
but the neighborhood...

00:26:55.262 --> 00:26:57.695
It's gone to seed a little.
There's no denying that.

00:26:57.730 --> 00:27:00.096
But that's why what the church
does here is so important.

00:27:00.128 --> 00:27:02.096
Like i always say, you
can expect a miracle,

00:27:02.128 --> 00:27:04.128
But in the meantime,
you work your butt off.

00:27:04.161 --> 00:27:05.896
Yeah, we heard about the murders.

00:27:05.929 --> 00:27:07.829
The victims were parishioners of mine.

00:27:07.862 --> 00:27:09.429
I've known them for years.

00:27:09.462 --> 00:27:12.096
And the killers said that
an angel made them do that?

00:27:12.128 --> 00:27:14.262
Yes. Misguided souls.

00:27:14.295 --> 00:27:16.028
To think that god's messenger

00:27:16.061 --> 00:27:19.096
Would appear and incite people
to murder -- It's tragic.

00:27:19.128 --> 00:27:21.563
So, you don't believe in
those angel yarns, huh?

00:27:21.596 --> 00:27:23.295
Oh, no, i absolutely believe.

00:27:23.329 --> 00:27:25.195
It kind of goes with
the job description.

00:27:25.228 --> 00:27:27.630
Father, that's michael, right?

00:27:27.663 --> 00:27:29.695
That's right.

00:27:29.730 --> 00:27:33.762
The archangel michael,
with the flaming sword --

00:27:33.795 --> 00:27:36.161
The fighter of demons,

00:27:36.195 --> 00:27:39.161
Holy force against evil.

00:27:39.195 --> 00:27:41.228
So, they're not really
the hallmark-Card version

00:27:41.262 --> 00:27:43.295
That everybody thinks?

00:27:43.329 --> 00:27:45.161
They're fierce, right? Vigilant.

00:27:45.195 --> 00:27:47.896
I like to think of them as
more loving than wrathful,

00:27:47.929 --> 00:27:49.663
But, yes,

00:27:49.695 --> 00:27:53.429
A lot of scripture paints
angels as god's warriors.

00:27:53.462 --> 00:27:55.996
"An angel of the lord appeared to them,

00:27:56.028 --> 00:27:58.862
"The glory of the lord
shone down upon them,

00:27:58.896 --> 00:28:01.862
And they were terrified."

00:28:06.061 --> 00:28:08.663
Luke 2:9.

00:28:14.563 --> 00:28:16.663
Well, thank you for
speaking with us, father.

00:28:16.695 --> 00:28:18.762
It's my pleasure. Hope to see you again.

00:28:18.795 --> 00:28:20.896
Father, what's all that for?

00:28:22.195 --> 00:28:25.429
Oh, that's for fr. Gregory.
He was a priest here.

00:28:25.462 --> 00:28:26.663
Was?

00:28:26.695 --> 00:28:28.462
Passed away right on these steps.

00:28:28.496 --> 00:28:30.329
He's interred in the church crypt.

00:28:30.362 --> 00:28:32.096
When did this happen?

00:28:32.128 --> 00:28:35.496
Two months ago. He was
shot for his car keys.

00:28:35.529 --> 00:28:36.663
I'm sorry.

00:28:36.695 --> 00:28:40.128
Yeah, me too. He was a good friend.

00:28:40.161 --> 00:28:43.695
I didn't even have time to
administer his last rites.

00:28:43.730 --> 00:28:46.128
But like i said, it's
a tough neighborhood.

00:28:46.161 --> 00:28:50.262
And ever since he died, i've
been praying my heart out.

00:28:50.295 --> 00:28:51.262
For what?

00:28:51.295 --> 00:28:52.630
For deliverance...

00:28:52.663 --> 00:28:54.962
From the violence and
the bloodshed around here.

00:28:56.462 --> 00:29:00.362
We could use a little divine
intervention, i suppose.

00:29:00.396 --> 00:29:02.962
Well, padre, thanks.

00:29:02.996 --> 00:29:04.596
We'll see you again.

00:29:16.896 --> 00:29:19.161
Well, it's all starting to make sense.

00:29:19.195 --> 00:29:21.563
Devoted priest dies
a violent death --

00:29:21.596 --> 00:29:24.128
That's vengeful-Spirit
material right there.

00:29:24.161 --> 00:29:26.563
He knew all the stiffs 'cause
they went to church here.

00:29:26.596 --> 00:29:28.529
I'm willing to bet,
because he was their priest,

00:29:28.563 --> 00:29:30.529
He knew things about them
that nobody else knew.

00:29:30.563 --> 00:29:34.161
Then again, fr. Reynolds
started praying for god's help

00:29:34.195 --> 00:29:35.762
About two months ago, right?

00:29:35.795 --> 00:29:38.329
Right about the time all this started?

00:29:38.362 --> 00:29:41.195
Oh, come on, man. What's
your deal? What do you mean?

00:29:41.228 --> 00:29:43.161
Look, i'll admit, i'm
a bit of a skeptic,

00:29:43.195 --> 00:29:45.096
But since when are
you all mr. "700 club?"

00:29:45.128 --> 00:29:47.395
Seriously, from the get-Go,

00:29:47.429 --> 00:29:49.730
You've been willing to
buy this angel crap, man.

00:29:49.762 --> 00:29:52.795
What's next? Are you gonna
start praying every day?

00:29:52.829 --> 00:29:54.396
I do.

00:29:55.962 --> 00:29:56.929
What?

00:29:56.962 --> 00:29:59.228
I do pray every day.

00:29:59.262 --> 00:30:01.195
I have for a long time.

00:30:04.896 --> 00:30:07.396
The things you learn about a guy.

00:30:07.429 --> 00:30:09.563
Huh.

00:30:10.596 --> 00:30:14.128
Come on. Let's go check
out fr. Gregory's grave.

00:30:56.851 --> 00:30:58.619
Sam, come on, get the lead out.

00:31:00.918 --> 00:31:02.786
Sammy?

00:31:04.452 --> 00:31:06.518
Sammy! Hey.

00:31:07.552 --> 00:31:09.753
Okay?

00:31:09.786 --> 00:31:11.518
Yeah.

00:31:11.552 --> 00:31:13.952
Yeah.

00:31:17.235 --> 00:31:19.269
Come on.

00:31:23.635 --> 00:31:25.969
You saw it, didn't you? Didn't you?

00:31:26.003 --> 00:31:28.835
Yeah. Yeah.

00:31:28.869 --> 00:31:31.036
Dean, i saw an angel.

00:31:31.070 --> 00:31:32.936
You
--

00:31:35.170 --> 00:31:36.702
All right, come on.

00:31:38.835 --> 00:31:40.568
I don't want a drink.

00:31:44.003 --> 00:31:48.070
So, what makes you think
you saw a, uh, angel?

00:31:48.103 --> 00:31:50.835
Just...

00:31:50.869 --> 00:31:53.202
It appeared before
me, and i just --

00:31:53.235 --> 00:31:56.202
This feeling washed over me, you know?

00:31:56.235 --> 00:31:59.568
Like -- Like
peace, like grace.

00:31:59.601 --> 00:32:01.936
Okay, ecstasy boy, maybe we'll get you

00:32:01.969 --> 00:32:04.735
Some glow sticks and a
nice dr. Seuss hat, huh?

00:32:04.768 --> 00:32:06.768
Dean, i'm serious.

00:32:06.802 --> 00:32:08.902
It spoke to me. It knew who i was.

00:32:08.936 --> 00:32:11.436
It's just a spirit, sam.

00:32:11.501 --> 00:32:13.601
And it's not the first one

00:32:13.635 --> 00:32:15.269
To be able to read people's minds.

00:32:15.302 --> 00:32:17.469
Okay, let
me guess --

00:32:17.501 --> 00:32:19.501
You were personally chosen
to smite some sinner?

00:32:19.536 --> 00:32:21.568
You just got to wait
for me divine bat signal.

00:32:21.601 --> 00:32:24.436
Is that it? Yeah, actually.

00:32:24.469 --> 00:32:26.536
Great.

00:32:26.568 --> 00:32:29.170
I don't suppose you asked
what this alleged bad guy did.

00:32:29.202 --> 00:32:33.302
Actually, i did, dean,
and the angel told me.

00:32:33.336 --> 00:32:35.601
He hasn't done anything... yet.

00:32:35.635 --> 00:32:38.070
But he will.

00:32:38.103 --> 00:32:40.768
Oh, this is -- I
don't believe this.

00:32:40.802 --> 00:32:43.003
Dean, the angel hasn't been wrong yet.

00:32:43.036 --> 00:32:46.202
Someone's gonna do something
awful, and i can stop it.

00:32:46.235 --> 00:32:48.568
You're supposed to be bad, too, sam.

00:32:48.601 --> 00:32:50.070
Maybe i should stop you right now.

00:32:50.103 --> 00:32:52.036
You know what, dean? I don't understand.

00:32:52.070 --> 00:32:54.135
Why can't you even
consider the possibility?

00:32:54.170 --> 00:32:56.501
What, that this is an angel? Yes.

00:32:56.536 --> 00:32:59.601
Maybe we're hunting an angel
here, and we should stop.

00:32:59.635 --> 00:33:02.369
Maybe this is god's will.

00:33:02.402 --> 00:33:04.936
Okay. All right.

00:33:04.969 --> 00:33:07.070
You know what? I get
it. You've got faith.

00:33:07.103 --> 00:33:08.702
That's -- Hey,
good for you.

00:33:08.735 --> 00:33:10.501
I'm sure it makes things easier.

00:33:12.003 --> 00:33:14.269
I'll tell you who else
had faith like that -- Mom.

00:33:15.902 --> 00:33:18.036
She used to tell me
when she tucked me in

00:33:18.070 --> 00:33:20.269
That angels were watching over us.

00:33:20.302 --> 00:33:22.802
In fact, that was the last
thing she ever said to me.

00:33:22.835 --> 00:33:24.601
You never told me that.

00:33:24.635 --> 00:33:26.436
What's to tell?

00:33:26.469 --> 00:33:28.103
She was wrong.

00:33:28.135 --> 00:33:31.070
There was nothing protecting her.

00:33:31.103 --> 00:33:34.436
There's no higher power. There's no god.

00:33:34.469 --> 00:33:37.568
There's just chaos and violence

00:33:37.601 --> 00:33:42.469
And random, unpredictable
evil that comes out of nowhere

00:33:42.501 --> 00:33:44.869
And rips you to shreds.

00:33:44.902 --> 00:33:47.436
You want me to believe in this stuff?

00:33:47.469 --> 00:33:49.369
I'm gonna need to see some hard proof.

00:33:49.402 --> 00:33:50.568
You got any?

00:33:53.036 --> 00:33:54.436
Well, i do.

00:33:54.469 --> 00:33:57.302
Proof that we're dealing with a spirit.

00:34:05.501 --> 00:34:07.135
That looks
like --

00:34:07.170 --> 00:34:08.668
It's wormwood...

00:34:08.702 --> 00:34:10.469
A plant associated with the dead,

00:34:10.501 --> 00:34:12.601
Specifically the ones
that are not at rest.

00:34:12.635 --> 00:34:14.969
I don't see it growing anywhere else,

00:34:15.003 --> 00:34:17.635
Except over the
murdered priest's marker.

00:34:17.668 --> 00:34:20.336
It's him, sam.

00:34:20.369 --> 00:34:22.269
Maybe.

00:34:23.702 --> 00:34:25.103
Maybe?

00:34:25.135 --> 00:34:26.969
Dean, i don't know what to think.

00:34:27.003 --> 00:34:28.668
Okay.

00:34:30.501 --> 00:34:32.902
Want some more proof?
I'll give you more proof.

00:34:32.936 --> 00:34:34.336
How?

00:34:34.369 --> 00:34:36.568
We'll summon gregory's spirit.

00:34:36.601 --> 00:34:38.202
What?

00:34:38.235 --> 00:34:41.036
Here? In the church?

00:34:41.070 --> 00:34:42.702
Yeah.

00:34:42.735 --> 00:34:45.869
Yeah, we just need a few odds and ends

00:34:45.902 --> 00:34:48.269
And that sance ritual in dad's journal.

00:34:48.302 --> 00:34:51.402
A sance, great. I
hope whoopi's available.

00:34:51.436 --> 00:34:53.601
That's funny, actually. Seriously.

00:34:55.103 --> 00:34:56.802
If fr. Gregory's spirit is around,

00:34:56.835 --> 00:34:58.702
The sance will bring him right to us.

00:34:58.735 --> 00:35:01.601
If it's him, then we'll put him to rest.

00:35:01.635 --> 00:35:03.835
But if it's an angel, it won't show.

00:35:03.869 --> 00:35:05.601
Nothing will happen.

00:35:05.635 --> 00:35:07.103
Exactly.

00:35:07.135 --> 00:35:09.003
It's one of the perks of the job, sam.

00:35:09.036 --> 00:35:10.735
We don't have to operate on faith.

00:35:10.768 --> 00:35:13.070
We can know for sure.

00:35:13.103 --> 00:35:15.202
Don't you want to know for sure?

00:35:21.802 --> 00:35:23.635
Dude...

00:35:23.668 --> 00:35:24.835
All right, i'll admit,

00:35:24.869 --> 00:35:27.469
We've gone pretty ghetto
with the spell work before,

00:35:27.501 --> 00:35:28.735
But this takes the cake.

00:35:28.768 --> 00:35:31.635
I mean, a spongebob place
mat instead of an altar cloth?

00:35:31.668 --> 00:35:33.936
We'll just put it
spongebob-Side-Down.

00:35:37.802 --> 00:35:39.369
Dean, that's it.

00:35:39.402 --> 00:35:40.436
What?

00:35:40.469 --> 00:35:42.936
That's the sign.

00:35:42.969 --> 00:35:44.702
Where?

00:35:44.735 --> 00:35:45.936
Right behind that guy.

00:35:45.969 --> 00:35:47.702
That's him, dean.

00:35:47.735 --> 00:35:50.103
And we have to stop him.

00:35:56.452 --> 00:35:57.719
Wait a minute.

00:35:57.751 --> 00:35:59.119
What are you doing?

00:35:59.152 --> 00:36:02.219
You're not gonna kill somebody
because a ghost told you to.

00:36:02.253 --> 00:36:04.586
I'm not gonna kill
him. I'm gonna stop him.

00:36:04.619 --> 00:36:07.786
Define "stop," huh? I
mean, what are you gonna do?

00:36:07.818 --> 00:36:09.552
Dean, please.

00:36:09.586 --> 00:36:11.420
He's gonna hurt someone. You know it.

00:36:13.985 --> 00:36:16.818
All right, come on.

00:36:22.853 --> 00:36:24.119
Dean.

00:36:25.487 --> 00:36:26.818
Unlock my door.

00:36:26.853 --> 00:36:28.985
You're not killing anyone, sam.

00:36:29.018 --> 00:36:30.952
I got this guy. You go do the sance.

00:36:30.985 --> 00:36:32.885
Dean.

00:38:03.952 --> 00:38:05.985
What are you doing?

00:38:06.018 --> 00:38:08.018
What is this?

00:38:11.253 --> 00:38:14.952
Father, please. I can explain.

00:38:14.985 --> 00:38:16.985
Uh...

00:38:17.018 --> 00:38:19.452
Actually, maybe i can't. Um...

00:38:22.286 --> 00:38:25.219
This is a... a sance.

00:38:25.253 --> 00:38:26.786
A sance?

00:38:26.818 --> 00:38:29.219
Young man, you are in a house of god.

00:38:29.253 --> 00:38:31.719
It's based on early christian
rites, if that helps.

00:38:31.751 --> 00:38:33.751
Enough. You're coming with me.

00:38:33.786 --> 00:38:36.686
Father, please, just wait a second.

00:38:39.186 --> 00:38:41.320
Oh, my god.

00:38:43.119 --> 00:38:45.420
Is that...

00:38:45.452 --> 00:38:47.186
Is that an angel?

00:38:47.219 --> 00:38:49.652
No, it's not.

00:38:49.686 --> 00:38:54.052
It's just fr. Gregory.

00:39:00.686 --> 00:39:02.152
Thomas!

00:39:02.186 --> 00:39:05.519
I've come in answer to your prayers.

00:39:24.686 --> 00:39:27.751
Sam....i thought i
sent you on your path.

00:39:27.786 --> 00:39:29.586
You should hurry.

00:39:30.853 --> 00:39:32.085
Father, i'm sorry.

00:39:34.985 --> 00:39:36.853
But you're not an angel.

00:39:36.885 --> 00:39:38.786
Of course i am.

00:39:38.818 --> 00:39:40.885
No.

00:39:40.918 --> 00:39:42.253
You're a man.

00:39:42.286 --> 00:39:45.952
You're a spirit.

00:39:45.985 --> 00:39:47.751
And you need to rest.

00:39:47.786 --> 00:39:50.186
I was a man...

00:39:50.219 --> 00:39:51.719
But now i'm an angel.

00:39:54.253 --> 00:39:57.018
I was on the steps at the church.

00:39:57.052 --> 00:40:00.286
I felt that bullet
pierce right through me.

00:40:00.320 --> 00:40:03.152
But there was no pain.

00:40:03.186 --> 00:40:06.420
And, suddenly, i could see...

00:40:06.452 --> 00:40:08.085
Everything.

00:40:10.619 --> 00:40:12.452
Fr. Reynolds, i saw you...

00:40:12.487 --> 00:40:15.385
Praying and crying here.

00:40:15.420 --> 00:40:18.452
I came to help you.

00:40:18.487 --> 00:40:20.487
Help me how?

00:40:48.018 --> 00:40:49.586
Damn it!

00:40:50.985 --> 00:40:52.652
Those
murders --

00:40:52.686 --> 00:40:55.385
That was because of you?

00:40:55.420 --> 00:40:57.286
I received the word of god.

00:40:57.320 --> 00:41:00.286
He spoke to me, told
me to smite the wicked.

00:41:00.320 --> 00:41:02.519
I'm carrying out his will.

00:41:02.552 --> 00:41:04.519
You're driving innocent people to kill.

00:41:04.552 --> 00:41:07.952
Those innocent people are
being offered redemption.

00:41:10.818 --> 00:41:12.719
Some people need redemption.

00:41:12.751 --> 00:41:14.786
Don't they, sam?

00:41:16.186 --> 00:41:17.918
How can you call this redemption?

00:41:20.085 --> 00:41:22.353
You can't understand it now.

00:41:22.385 --> 00:41:24.818
But the rules of man
and the rules of god

00:41:24.853 --> 00:41:26.253
Are two very different things.

00:41:26.286 --> 00:41:30.253
Those people --
They're locked up.

00:41:30.286 --> 00:41:31.818
No, they're happy.

00:41:31.853 --> 00:41:35.219
They've found peace,
beaten their demons.

00:41:35.253 --> 00:41:37.586
And i've given them the keys to heaven.

00:41:37.619 --> 00:41:39.586
No, no. This is vengeance.

00:41:39.619 --> 00:41:41.018
It's wrong.

00:41:41.052 --> 00:41:44.085
Thomas, this goes against
everything you believed.

00:41:44.119 --> 00:41:46.186
You're lost, misguided.

00:41:46.219 --> 00:41:49.686
Father... no, i'm not misguided.

00:41:49.719 --> 00:41:52.018
You are not an angel, thomas.

00:41:52.052 --> 00:41:54.219
Men cannot be angels.

00:41:57.085 --> 00:41:59.487
But...

00:41:59.519 --> 00:42:02.385
But i-I don't understand.

00:42:06.751 --> 00:42:08.385
You prayed for me to come.

00:42:08.420 --> 00:42:10.853
I prayed for god's help, not this.

00:42:10.885 --> 00:42:14.286
What you're doing is not god's will.

00:42:14.320 --> 00:42:16.452
"Thou shalt not kill."

00:42:16.487 --> 00:42:18.487
That's the word of god.

00:42:27.219 --> 00:42:29.052
How come we stopped?

00:42:34.353 --> 00:42:38.686
Um, weren't we gonna go to the movies?

00:42:40.918 --> 00:42:43.853
We should go, or we're gonna be late.

00:42:43.885 --> 00:42:45.487
I'm sorry.

00:42:45.519 --> 00:42:47.519
It's just, i've never done this before.

00:42:49.253 --> 00:42:51.952
Look, i said i was sorry.

00:42:51.985 --> 00:42:53.751
Please...

00:43:01.452 --> 00:43:03.052
Stop it!

00:43:16.018 --> 00:43:17.952
Are you okay? Are you okay?

00:43:17.985 --> 00:43:20.985
Thank god! Thank god!

00:43:22.519 --> 00:43:23.619
Damn it.

00:43:23.652 --> 00:43:24.885
Are you sure you're okay?

00:43:24.918 --> 00:43:28.786
You have a cellphone? Call 911.

00:43:45.686 --> 00:43:47.619
Let us help you.

00:43:47.652 --> 00:43:49.853
No.

00:43:49.885 --> 00:43:52.686
It's time to rest,
thomas, to be at peace.

00:43:52.719 --> 00:43:56.152
Please. Let me give you last rites.

00:44:04.618 --> 00:44:06.353
O holy hosts above,

00:44:06.385 --> 00:44:09.185
I call upon thee as a servant of christ

00:44:09.219 --> 00:44:11.685
To sanctify our actions this day

00:44:11.719 --> 00:44:13.952
In fulfillment of the will of god.

00:44:20.319 --> 00:44:22.618
Fr. Reynolds?

00:44:22.652 --> 00:44:25.152
Rest.

00:44:34.885 --> 00:44:37.885
I call upon the archangel raphael,

00:44:37.918 --> 00:44:42.119
Master of the air, to make open the way.

00:44:42.152 --> 00:44:46.152
Let the fire of the
holy spirit now descend,

00:44:46.185 --> 00:44:50.818
That this being might be
awakened to the world beyond.

00:46:17.119 --> 00:46:18.818
Holy...

00:46:56.536 --> 00:46:58.402
<i>How was your day?</i>

00:47:06.436 --> 00:47:08.135
You were right.

00:47:10.202 --> 00:47:12.668
It wasn't an angel. It was gregory.

00:47:34.536 --> 00:47:37.536
I don't know, dean, i just...

00:47:42.536 --> 00:47:45.735
I wanted to believe...

00:47:45.768 --> 00:47:48.269
So badly.

00:47:50.202 --> 00:47:52.536
It's so damn
hard to do this --

00:47:52.568 --> 00:47:54.969
What
we do --

00:47:55.002 --> 00:47:58.469
All alone, you know?

00:47:58.501 --> 00:48:00.868
There's so much evil
out in the world, dean,

00:48:00.902 --> 00:48:03.402
I feel like i could drown in it.

00:48:03.436 --> 00:48:05.302
And when i think about my destiny,

00:48:05.336 --> 00:48:07.135
When i think about how i could end up...

00:48:07.170 --> 00:48:10.601
Yeah, well, don't worry
about that, all right?

00:48:10.635 --> 00:48:13.601
I'm watching out for you.

00:48:13.635 --> 00:48:15.835
Yeah, i know you are.

00:48:18.269 --> 00:48:20.702
But you're just one person, dean.

00:48:22.935 --> 00:48:24.668
And i needed to think

00:48:24.702 --> 00:48:27.536
That there was something
else watching, too, you know?

00:48:27.568 --> 00:48:32.202
Some...higher power,

00:48:32.235 --> 00:48:35.336
Some greater good.

00:48:36.969 --> 00:48:40.103
And that maybe...

00:48:40.135 --> 00:48:43.069
Maybe what?

00:48:45.935 --> 00:48:48.235
Maybe i could be saved.

00:48:54.902 --> 00:48:59.402
But, you know, that
just clouded my judgment.

00:48:59.436 --> 00:49:01.402
And you're right.

00:49:01.436 --> 00:49:03.935
I mean, we got to go with what we know,

00:49:03.969 --> 00:49:06.302
With what's right there in
front of our own two eyes.

00:49:06.336 --> 00:49:08.868
Well, it's funny you say that.

00:49:11.568 --> 00:49:12.568
Why?

00:49:15.668 --> 00:49:18.336
Gregory's spirit gave you
some pretty good information.

00:49:18.369 --> 00:49:21.568
That guy in the car was bad news.

00:49:21.601 --> 00:49:23.469
I barely got there in time.

00:49:23.501 --> 00:49:25.601
What happened?

00:49:25.635 --> 00:49:27.902
He's dead.

00:49:30.436 --> 00:49:32.135
Did you...

00:49:32.170 --> 00:49:33.436
No.

00:49:36.069 --> 00:49:39.103
But i'll tell you one thing.

00:49:39.135 --> 00:49:41.103
The way he died,

00:49:41.135 --> 00:49:43.702
If i hadn't have seen
it with my own two eyes,

00:49:43.735 --> 00:49:45.601
I never would have believed it.

00:49:45.635 --> 00:49:48.002
I mean...

00:49:48.036 --> 00:49:50.002
I don't know what to call it.

00:49:53.469 --> 00:49:54.835
What?

00:49:58.369 --> 00:50:00.103
Dean, what did you see?

00:50:02.501 --> 00:50:03.935
Maybe

00:50:08.436 --> 00:50:10.635
God's will.



00:10:08.592 --> 00:10:10.092
